The 22 SQL files in this directory are the TPC-H queries from the TPC-H
specification, with the specification's usual substitution values. They
are the Transaction Processing Performance Council's, not this repository's
author's, and are not covered by the repository's Apache-2.0 license. They
are here to benchmark lexdb. TPC-H, TPC-C, TPC-DS and TPC are trademarks of
the Transaction Processing Performance Council.

These copies came from Apache DataFusion's benchmarks/queries on
2026-11-15, where the standard queries are published with their
substitution literals.
